WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
This new AI proves that we are so unbelievably cooked

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.060
and it's not even funny.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.440
So over the past two weeks or so,

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.620
this new motion control AI has been released

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.360
by a bunch of companies where basically

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.700
you can make anybody do anything

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.420
as you are seeing behind me right now.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.160
Like this guy who decided to use this software

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.520
with the entire cast of Stranger Things

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.200
that mimic each and every exact movement that he does.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.100
Or this guy who decided to do it with a streamer

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.020
who I'm not sure is real or not,

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.880
but still the point is, this is terrifying.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.220
And sure, on paper, you're probably like,

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.720
whoa, this is pretty cool. This is a new age of technology. But then you actually start thinking

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.660
about it. Yeah, this is going to get terrifying really fast. And this is like the dinosaur

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.660
asteroid about to hit the entire creative industry. And that's why I keep telling people

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:46.540
that being imperfect is actually perfect. But the scariest part about all of this is that this

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:50.840
is the worst it's ever going to be. It is only going to get better from here. So if you ever

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:54.600
thought about starting a personal brand, I would have started yesterday because once people catch

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:59.760
onto this and it starts becoming more mainstream, it's over. And in my opinion, I've been like this

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:04.500
all along. If you're going to use AI for content creation, use it as a tool and not to replace you

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.460
entirely. So if you want to see the AI tools that I use for my content creation while also staying

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.080
real and authentic, just comment the word science or go look at my bio.
